m_text","source_text":"おおっ、そのまま…！","source_fingerprint":"88efee236d3e301741a85dcbc3643f8bab4217eea185bdb40b0c9c0fd3af6e8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140012"],"target_text":"Ồ, cứ thế...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:ce4c7a326d1654157618c610","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"カワイイ、カワイイ♡","source_fingerprint":"2f4b039911b5c85cf7f9d958ce1b5ba5cc9f5993a7e30d13b331019da41add5d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140013"],"target_text":"Dễ thương, dễ thương quá♡","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:d9344e435a6e5cf0d45b02b5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"あぁ～…。","source_fingerprint":"1c6a912ff16639f71ab3fb0ee324efad244e72493124a682ad31d2a234315ac9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140014"],"target_text":"Aaa~...","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:d47cd69a856ae0d0cb1eacc4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"いけ～。","source_fingerprint":"2d26ab508d752311a80bd57d009827b7ccfa666dda4549d4db619d1cacfbd958","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140015"],"target_text":"Tiến lên~.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:00ba29c1b77e19afeef0875a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"どうしたの？代わろうか？","source_fingerprint":"74de1b297de8b8585ec9ac8986af7c034e69a927f7b8a25c146fbdf59441f2b5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140016"],"target_text":"Sao thế? Để tôi làm thay nhé?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:77fbdd32511e58d3287c4aed","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ごめ～ん～痛いよね～。","source_fingerprint":"97481a8e5feed836d402670d477d872c51c443251546478fe8e482b45f2df12d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140017"],"target_text":"Xin lỗi nhé~ đau lắm nhỉ~.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:bc6efc642ddace01147ff11b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"はっ！","source_fingerprint":"dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","140018"],"target_text":"Hây!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:bc6b8917188991aec4d1d41d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"明日はこれだって。楽しみだね。","source_fingerprint":"9601230d9eb91834c7ead305cc18569bf05c5d77d8b6ca3df77095e18f86d5ff","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","15"],"target_text":"Ngày mai là cái này đấy. Mong chờ thật nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:b0d0fd179580b5f99d0d1c13","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"『やれる…私はやれる…』\r\nこの程度の疲れなら、まだ。","source_fingerprint":"0e16e55417c6dccd2e6c6c0dd3d57433b2c696878d9ca51dfd14ac175486557f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20000"],"target_text":"『Mình làm được... Mình làm được...』\r\nMệt cỡ này thì vẫn chưa sao.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:c491a078062595fce23a479d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"この状態でのトレーニングは\r\n効果的とは言えないかも…。\r\n休養を挟むのはどうかな？","source_fingerprint":"759d009939249296da9126bc042247727c844afe6966c1f3692040105d527e63","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20001"],"target_text":"Training trong tình trạng này\r\ncó lẽ không hiệu quả lắm...\r\nHay là nghỉ ngơi một chút?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":75,"uid":"zhcn:dfb7779e82315c2f53434e71","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"『私は最高の成果を上げる！』\r\n…よし、始めよう！\r\nいいトレーニングができそうだ！","source_fingerprint":"93f26a759d30629f446ef09fe7746a8e05f6ea6b29304776db5b6a8e84a55c9d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20002"],"target_text":"『Mình sẽ đạt kết quả tốt nhất!』\r\n...Được, bắt đầu thôi!\r\nCó vẻ sẽ là một buổi Training tốt đây!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":76,"uid":"zhcn:783e0e3838619f7a141cd107","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"うん、わかる。今日はやれる！\r\n期待してくれていいよ、\r\nトレーナーさん。","source_fingerprint":"3e9ca234ea4b6c0a3872528bb004a9e9070371a6206c274253c96e2b03bf3e76","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20003"],"target_text":"Ừ, tôi biết mà. Hôm nay tôi làm được!\r\nCứ kỳ vọng vào tôi nhé,\r\nTrainer.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":77,"uid":"zhcn:bc8c4c4cbbd84c9b0eccbe6c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"トレーニングあるのみ！だよね。\r\n基礎を大事に積み重ねていくのが、\r\n1番の近道だ。","source_fingerprint":"dba938199d11082234a01a09483639a1a9a0aefa8bc7ad9a4d3bc3b73588ef0d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20004"],"target_text":"Cứ Training thôi! Đúng không?\r\nChú trọng nền tảng rồi tích lũy từng bước\r\nmới là con đường ngắn nhất.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":78,"uid":"zhcn:39222de9acaa55f071653c18","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今ごろ幼馴染のみんなもどこかで\r\n頑張ってるんだろうな…。\r\nふふっ、負けられないね！","source_fingerprint":"c91a97c65f738a0d20f852cd7c1dc88ca4ff5e5ad70b79e9dab2e26c24d382fd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20005"],"target_text":"Giờ này chắc mấy người bạn thuở nhỏ\r\ncũng đang cố gắng ở đâu đó...\r\nFufu, tôi không thể thua được!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":79,"uid":"zhcn:cea0cffd24bfb900da98e836","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"準備はできてるよ。\r\nいい感じにリラックスできてる。\r\nさあ、やろうか。","source_fingerprint":"354a8a03fb52ebee84c83cb063713c3486747721dfeda34cb79d0f8c592e3f3d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1124","20006"],"target_text":"Tôi sẵn sàng rồi.\r\nTôi đang thư giãn rất tốt.\r\nNào, bắt đầu thôi.","reviewed":true}]}